@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `nii-il33-nouns`
IMPORT `nii-family-allowance-regulations`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Tests: the Family Allowance Regulations 5720-1960, regulations 1 and 11. Row IL-33.
-- Every expected value was worked by hand from the Hebrew (lines 19 and 49) before the run.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Tests — regulation 1: the twelve months before the period`

-- The allowance for March 2026 (the period begins 1 March 2026): the twelve months before are 1 March 2025 to
-- 28 February 2026 inclusive.
#ASSERT `FA reg 1 — the first day of the period of support before the period beginning` (YMD 2026 3 1) EQUALS YMD 2025 3 1
#ASSERT `FA reg 1 — the day` (YMD 2025 3 1) `is in the period of support before the period beginning` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT `FA reg 1 — the day` (YMD 2026 2 28) `is in the period of support before the period beginning` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT `FA reg 1 — the day` (YMD 2025 2 28) `is in the period of support before the period beginning` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT `FA reg 1 — the day` (YMD 2026 3 1) `is in the period of support before the period beginning` (YMD 2026 3 1)
-- A leap year: the allowance for March 2024; the twelve months before begin 1 March 2023 and end on 29 February 2024.
#ASSERT `FA reg 1 — the first day of the period of support before the period beginning` (YMD 2024 3 1) EQUALS YMD 2023 3 1
#ASSERT `FA reg 1 — the day` (YMD 2024 2 29) `is in the period of support before the period beginning` (YMD 2024 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT `FA reg 1 — the day` (YMD 2024 3 1) `is in the period of support before the period beginning` (YMD 2024 3 1)

§ `Tests — regulation 11: an allowance in doubt`

-- A doubt arose on 10 January 2026. Ninety days after is 10 April 2026 (21 days to 31 January, 28 to 28 February,
-- 31 to 31 March, 10 to 10 April: 90). Not cleared: suspended from the day it arose to 10 April inclusive.
#ASSERT NOT `FA reg 11 — payment may be suspended, a doubt having arisen on` (YMD 2026 1 10) `and been cleared on` NOTHING `, on` (YMD 2026 1 9)
#ASSERT `FA reg 11 — payment may be suspended, a doubt having arisen on` (YMD 2026 1 10) `and been cleared on` NOTHING `, on` (YMD 2026 1 10)
#ASSERT `FA reg 11 — payment may be suspended, a doubt having arisen on` (YMD 2026 1 10) `and been cleared on` NOTHING `, on` (YMD 2026 4 10)
#ASSERT NOT `FA reg 11 — payment may be suspended, a doubt having arisen on` (YMD 2026 1 10) `and been cleared on` NOTHING `, on` (YMD 2026 4 11)
-- Cleared on 5 February 2026: suspended until the day before.
#ASSERT `FA reg 11 — payment may be suspended, a doubt having arisen on` (YMD 2026 1 10) `and been cleared on` (JUST (YMD 2026 2 5)) `, on` (YMD 2026 2 4)
#ASSERT NOT `FA reg 11 — payment may be suspended, a doubt having arisen on` (YMD 2026 1 10) `and been cleared on` (JUST (YMD 2026 2 5)) `, on` (YMD 2026 2 5)
